s given to them by others, this Count could lead them to the abyss when it has dropped to zero. In the year 305 of the Alcian calendar, Hina has inherited a mission from her Mother, whose Count has depreciated to zero, to search for the Legendary Red Baron. In her adventure, she meets a half-masked swordsman named Licht who tries to hide his identity, as he is known as a degenerate for having an incredibly low Count.","popularity":10.2603,"poster_path":"/A0XboGeodpGlj33QUtjPMMwrMkN.jpg","first_air_date":"2020-01-09","softcore":false,"name":"Plunderer","vote_average":8.3,"vote_count":795}],"total_pages":1001,"total_results":20001}},"sources":{"tmdb":true,"omdb":true,"fanart":true},"omdb":{"Title":"Ranma ½","Year":"1989–1990","Rated":"TV-14","Released":"01 Apr 1989","Runtime":"30 min","Genre":"Animation, Action, Comedy","Director":"N/A","Writer":"Rumiko Takahashi","Actors":"Kappei Yamaguchi, Megumi Hayashibara, Noriko Hidaka","Plot":"Rumiko Takahashi's story of a high school aged girl named Akane who finds herself engaged to be married because of an arrangement by her father. Unfortunately her fiance, Ranma, turns out to be less of a man than expected and was raised by a giant panda.","Language":"Japanese","Country":"Japan","Awards":"N/A","Poster":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BYjg3ZWY4YmMtYjU1OS00ZmU4LWJmODMtMjBlNmE2ZjkyNzJjXkEyXkFqcGc@._V1_QL75_UY562_CR8,0,380,562_.jpg","Ratings":[{"Source":"Internet Movie Database","Value":"7.9/10"}],"Metascore":"N/A","imdbRating":"7.9","imdbVotes":"6,687","imdbID":"tt0096686","Type":"series","totalSeasons":"1","Response":"True"},"fanart":{"clearart":[{"copyright":"Unknown","id":"15692","lang":"ja","likes":"0","url":"https://assets.fanart.tv/fanart/ranma--4f255ff23dfed.png"}],"clearart_count":1,"clearlogo":[{"copyright":"Unknown","id":"2900","lang":"en","likes":"1","url":"https://assets.fanart.tv/fanart/Ranma-76932.png"},{"copyright":"Unknown","id":"15536","lang":"ja","likes":"0","url":"https://assets.fanart.tv/fanart/ran